00:00:45.022 --> 00:00:46.578
I don't appreciate this.

00:00:46.578 --> 00:00:47.739
- Oh, I'm lovin' this.

00:00:47.739 --> 00:00:50.369
Every bite I take is
better than the last one.

00:00:50.839 --> 00:00:52.545
- This one has to be McDonald's.

00:00:52.545 --> 00:00:53.949
- That one's McDonald's.

00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:55.262
- Mm,mm,mm, mm.

00:00:55.262 --> 00:00:56.979
- It smells like alcohol and pancakes.

00:00:56.979 --> 00:00:58.500
- Nope, never mind, it's not McDonald's.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.105
- Not McDonald's.

00:00:59.105 --> 00:00:59.708
- Uh-uh.

00:00:59.708 --> 00:01:00.648
- Good presentation.

00:01:00.648 --> 00:01:02.249
- I don't wanna look at the meat.

00:01:02.249 --> 00:01:03.969
- There's very little cheese.

00:01:03.969 --> 00:01:04.909
- There's no cheese.

00:01:04.909 --> 00:01:06.302
- No, that's the worst one yet.

00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:07.083
- Yeah.

00:01:08.288 --> 00:01:09.460
- This is the worst smelling one by far.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.144
- Yeah, this smells like McDonald's.

00:01:11.144 --> 00:01:13.906
- This cheese, it just looks
like Frankenstein cheese.

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.044
It looks orange.

00:01:15.044 --> 00:01:16.345
- McDonald's is symmetrical.

00:01:16.345 --> 00:01:18.086
You can tell McDonald's cuz it's like very

00:01:18.086 --> 00:01:19.722
clearly made by machines.

00:01:19.722 --> 00:01:20.465
- It's not great.

00:01:20.465 --> 00:01:21.441
It's pretty good.

00:01:21.441 --> 00:01:22.602
- This tastes like America.

00:01:22.602 --> 00:01:23.478
- If this is McDonald's

00:01:23.478 --> 00:01:25.179
I'm really disappointed in McDonald's.

00:01:25.179 --> 00:01:27.315
- Yeah, this would only
be like if I was free,

00:01:27.315 --> 00:01:29.801
