00:01:57.419 --> 00:01:58.440
It's amazing.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:01:59.101
- This is good.

00:01:59.101 --> 00:02:01.215
It's really like the most mild in flavor.

00:02:01.215 --> 00:02:02.701
- I don't like the egg,

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.362
but it's so easy to just whip it off,

00:02:04.362 --> 00:02:05.615
and throw it out the window.

00:02:05.615 --> 00:02:06.787
- This has to be McDonald's.

00:02:06.787 --> 00:02:08.176
It has to be.

00:02:11.536 --> 00:02:12.593
- Overall I choose this one.
(bell ring)

00:02:12.593 --> 00:02:14.009
(bell ring)

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:15.413
- Jack in the box. (bell ring)

00:02:15.413 --> 00:02:16.876
- It's delicious.

00:02:16.876 --> 00:02:17.898
- Yeah, Jack in the Box is so good.

00:02:17.898 --> 00:02:19.232
- That one (bell ring)
is still my favorite.

00:02:19.232 --> 00:02:21.044
